00:16:03,483 --> 00:16:18,947
[SPEAKER_00]: Any examples of communities that have kind of a standardization along those lines, like almost a commission, a board and commission compensation plan, for lack of a better word, or some sort of minimum standard?

150
00:16:19,447 --> 00:16:22,928
[SPEAKER_00]: Because that could be an interesting way to go about that.

151
