00:16:30,530 --> 00:16:32,911
[SPEAKER_05]: Thank you very much, President Behrs.

153
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:52,743
[SPEAKER_05]: My experience has been that there isn't, but that doesn't, I certainly haven't surveyed all 351 cities and towns, but in the communities that I've worked in, I have not seen compensation for boards and committees by and large.

154
00:16:53,183 --> 00:17:02,565
[SPEAKER_05]: What I have seen is compensation has gone away in some cases, especially for even, you know,

155
