[SPEAKER_05]: the most prominent boards and committees, but it's starting to come back.

156
00:17:09,631 --> 00:17:18,317
[SPEAKER_05]: But it hasn't usually trickled down to all boards and committees because of budgetary constraints across organizations.

157
